The original postings follow this summary.
The problem was initially that I was running a pre-compiled version of
Samba, which didn't allow for Enhanced security (C2). Then I managed somehow
to get an old version of Samba, which apparently had some bugs. So finally I
downloaded the latest version of Samba (version 1.9.18p7), and compiled it,
and all is well.
