>                                     [Odd] Error Summary =

>                                     [Odd] EDC Corr Error"
>
>And error detected and corrected on Memory module 0, my first 128 memory=

>module,
>so this look like the faulty fru.

It shows as a correctable error, likely a single bit error.
uerf lies about it being severe priority, it isn't.... Digital likely
isn't going to fix that lie in uerf since they're moving to dia.
These can be fairly common with 2100's, the correctable errors which
only  become an issue if they start becoming frequent in which case
you'd want to schedule a preventative replacement.
As you've extracted above it is memory module 0.

>Below are the complete output of uerf and dia, any comment or idea =

