"Kristin (Kris) Larsen" wrote:

This is a wonderful thing for the admin to use.  I had an error in 
my prpasswd file for root and I could not log on to CDE as root, so 
I used the Command line login option to login as root, update the 
prpasswd then logout.  At that point I could login as root using 
CDE.  Apparently the last does not log all info to wtmp or utmp so 
that it shows the user as LOGIN instead.  Remember this, it could 
be useful to you as it was to me.
